<article class="note-sheet">
  <header><svg class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#note"/></svg><div><span>Example note</span><h3>Build instructions</h3></div></header>
  <div class="choices">
    <section><div class="setting"><svg class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#summary"/></svg><code>--disclosure summary</code></div>
      <h4>Agents read the summary</h4>
      <blockquote>“Build the CLI locally.”</blockquote>
      <p>The CLI also returns the title and metadata.</p>
    </section>
    <section><div class="setting"><svg class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#publish"/></svg><code>--storage shared</code></div>
      <h4>Sync publishes the full note in plaintext</h4>
      <div class="body-copy">From the repository root, build the CLI.<code>go build ./cmd/ctxferry</code></div>
      <p>Sync targets your dedicated private GitHub repository.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="storage-option"><strong>Keep a note on this device</strong><code>--storage local-only</code><span>Excluded from sync.</span></div>
</article>
